{"seq":2,"slug":"ssl-assumptions","title":"三大假设：半监督成立的三条公理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/foundations/ssl-assumptions","wordCount":1797,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"三大假设-半监督成立的三条公理\">三大假设：半监督成立的三条公理</h1><p>没有免费的午餐——如果对数据分布不做任何假设，无标签数据在数学上无法改善分类。这是一个可以证明的事实：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 完全无关，那么观察再多的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 也不会更新你对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y|x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的信念。所以每一个有效的半监督算法，本质上都在偷偷相信某种「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的结构泄露了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的信息」的假设。这一篇把这些假设明明白白摊开：它们是全 hub 所有方法赖以成立的三条公理，后面每一章都会指名道姓地回来引用其中之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-p-x-到-p-y-x-的桥\">核心概念：从 p(x) 到 p(y|x) 的桥</h2><p>三大假设可以看作对「结构—标签相关性」的三种不同刻画，它们并不互斥，而是同一直觉在不同粒度上的表述。下表先给出全景，随后各节展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假设</th>\n<th>直觉表述</th>\n<th>数学化身</th>\n<th>被哪类方法利用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平滑性假设</td>\n<td>相近的输入 → 相近的输出</td>\n<td>惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\nabla f|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，扰动不变性</td>\n<td>一致性正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类假设</td>\n<td>同簇样本同标签</td>\n<td>决策边界避开高密度区</td>\n<td>伪标签、熵最小化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低密度分离</td>\n<td>边界穿过低密度带</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 小处放边界</td>\n<td>TSVM、熵正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流形假设</td>\n<td>高维数据卧在低维流形上</td>\n<td>沿流形测地距离度量相似</td>\n<td>图方法、标签传播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>聚类假设与低密度分离其实是同一枚硬币的两面：说「同簇同标签」等价于说「边界别切穿簇、要走簇之间的低密度地带」。因此常把它们合称。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[无标签数据揭示 p x 结构] --&gt; B{结构如何关联标签}&#10;  B --&gt;|扰动下输出稳定| C[平滑性假设]&#10;  B --&gt;|数据成团&lt;br/&gt;边界走低密度带| D[聚类 / 低密度分离]&#10;  B --&gt;|数据卧于低维流形| E[流形假设]&#10;  C --&gt; F[一致性正则&lt;br/&gt;方法篇 2]&#10;  D --&gt; G[伪标签 熵最小化&lt;br/&gt;方法篇 1]&#10;  E --&gt; H[图 标签传播&lt;br/&gt;图篇 1]\">flowchart TD\n  A[无标签数据揭示 p x 结构] --&gt; B{结构如何关联标签}\n  B --&gt;|扰动下输出稳定| C[平滑性假设]\n  B --&gt;|数据成团&lt;br/&gt;边界走低密度带| D[聚类 / 低密度分离]\n  B --&gt;|数据卧于低维流形| E[流形假设]\n  C --&gt; F[一致性正则&lt;br/&gt;方法篇 2]\n  D --&gt; G[伪标签 熵最小化&lt;br/&gt;方法篇 1]\n  E --&gt; H[图 标签传播&lt;br/&gt;图篇 1]</pre><h2 id=\"平滑性假设-相近的输入应有相近的输出\">平滑性假设：相近的输入应有相近的输出</h2><p>平滑性假设说：如果两个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1, x_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在高密度区域里彼此接近，那么它们的标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_1, y_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也应接近。注意「在高密度区域里接近」这个限定很重要——跨越低密度带的接近不算数。把它写成正则项，就是要求分类函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 在数据密集处变化平缓：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega(f) = \\int \\|\\nabla f(x)\\|^2 \\, p(x) \\, dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在深度学习里，这个「输入微动、输出别乱跳」的思想被具体化为对扰动的不变性：给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 加一点噪声或做一次数据增强得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) \\approx f(\\tilde{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是一致性正则一整族方法的理论根基——它们不需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的真实标签，只要求预测在扰动前后一致。这条假设如何被 Π-model、Mean Teacher、UDA 兑现成损失函数，详见 <a href=\"../methods/consistency-regularization\">一致性正则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚类假设与低密度分离-边界该走哪\">聚类假设与低密度分离：边界该走哪</h2><p>聚类假设说：数据倾向于形成若干个簇，同一个簇内的样本更可能共享标签。它的等价陈述——低密度分离假设——则从决策边界的角度说：最优分界面应当穿过输入空间的低密度区域，而不是切开某个密集簇。这解释了 <a href=\"why-semi-supervised\">为何半监督</a> 里那个一维直觉为什么对：两坨高斯之间的稀疏地带就是低密度带，边界该落在那儿。</p>\n<p>利用这条假设最直接的手段是熵最小化。若我们相信边界不穿密集区，那么模型在无标签样本上的预测就应当是「尖锐」的（高置信、低熵），因为落在簇内部的点离边界远、该被自信地分类。于是给无标签数据加一项条件熵惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{ent} = -\\sum_{x \\in D_u} \\sum_{k} p(k|x)\\log p(k|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最小化它，等于把决策边界从密集区推开。伪标签之所以有效，本质也是熵最小化的一种硬版本——把 softmax 的软预测硬化成 one-hot 就是在强制低熵。这条线在 <a href=\"../methods/pseudo-labeling\">伪标签与自训练</a> 里展开。历史上支持向量机版本的实现是 TSVM（直推式 SVM），它显式地寻找一个让间隔穿过低密度带的超平面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流形假设-高维数据其实很低维\">流形假设：高维数据其实很低维</h2><p>流形假设说：高维输入数据（如像素、词向量）实际上集中分布在一个维度低得多的流形上，而分类的相关变化只沿着这个流形发生。一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>224</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>224</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">224\\times224</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">224</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">224</span></span></span></span></span> 的人脸图有五万多维，但真正自由变化的因素（姿态、光照、表情、身份）只有几十个——数据被约束在五万维空间里的一张低维「曲面」上。</p>\n<p>它与平滑性的区别在度量：平滑性用欧氏距离衡量「相近」，流形假设则要求用沿流形的测地距离。两个像素上看着接近的图，若在流形上隔着一道沟，就不该被判为同类。工程上无法解析地知道流形，于是用样本构造一张近邻图来逼近它：每个样本连向它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个最近邻，图上的最短路就近似测地距离。标签沿这张图扩散，就是标签传播。这套图机制是 <a href=\"../graph-generative/graph-based\">基于图的方法</a> 的全部基础，也与 <a href=\"../../../ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/spectral-methods\">图神经网络</a> 的谱图理论同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"假设失效时会发生什么\">假设失效时会发生什么</h2><p>三大假设不是永远成立的护身符。把它们和典型失效场景对齐，是诊断 SSL 翻车的第一步：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>聚类假设失效</strong>：类别在特征空间高度重叠、没有清晰簇结构（如某些嘈杂表格数据），此时伪标签会在重叠区大量犯错并自我强化，即确认偏差，详见 <a href=\"../practice/confirmation-bias\">确认偏差</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>同分布假设失效</strong>：无标签池混入训练集没有的新类别，平滑/聚类假设被域外样本破坏，模型把它们硬分进已知类，即类别失配，详见 <a href=\"../practice/class-mismatch\">类别失配</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>平滑性被增强破坏</strong>：如果数据增强太强，改变了样本的真实语义（如把猫增强成了另一物体），一致性正则会强迫模型对不同语义给一致输出，反而有害。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换句话说，第四章「实践」里的所有失效模式，都能追溯到这一篇的某条假设被违反。理解假设，就是理解 SSL 何时可信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>无假设则无半监督：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须泄露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的信息，否则无标签数据在数学上无用。</li>\n<li>平滑性假设 → 扰动不变性 → 一致性正则；聚类/低密度分离 → 熵最小化 → 伪标签；流形假设 → 图上测地距离 → 标签传播。</li>\n<li>三条假设是同一直觉的不同粒度，常联合使用。</li>\n<li>每一种 SSL 失效模式都对应某条假设被违反，这是诊断的起点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"why-semi-supervised\">为何半监督</a> 给出本篇假设的工程动机；<a href=\"ssl-taxonomy\">谱系</a> 按假设归类各方法族。</li>\n<li>本 hub：一致性正则吃平滑性（<a href=\"../methods/consistency-regularization\">方法篇 2</a>），伪标签吃聚类（<a href=\"../methods/pseudo-labeling\">方法篇 1</a>），图方法吃流形（<a href=\"../graph-generative/graph-based\">图篇 1</a>）。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../../ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/spectral-methods\">图神经网络——谱方法</a> 与流形假设的图拉普拉斯同源。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/foundations/curse-of-dimensionality\">降维</a> 从另一角度讲高维数据的低维本质。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Chapelle, Schölkopf, Zien, &quot;Semi-Supervised Learning&quot; (MIT Press 2006)；van Engelen &amp; Hoos, &quot;A survey on semi-supervised learning&quot; (Machine Learning, 2020)。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三大假设：半监督成立的三条公理","id":"三大假设-半监督成立的三条公理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从 p(x) 到 p(y|x) 的桥","id":"核心概念-从-p-x-到-p-y-x-的桥"},{"level":2,"text":"平滑性假设：相近的输入应有相近的输出","id":"平滑性假设-相近的输入应有相近的输出"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类假设与低密度分离：边界该走哪","id":"聚类假设与低密度分离-边界该走哪"},{"level":2,"text":"流形假设：高维数据其实很低维","id":"流形假设-高维数据其实很低维"},{"level":2,"text":"假设失效时会发生什么","id":"假设失效时会发生什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何半监督：标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/foundations/why-semi-supervised"},"next":{"title":"谱系：半监督方法的全景地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/foundations/ssl-taxonomy"}}